#: ../../source/components_basic/38-component_jdy31.rst:18
msgid "JDY-31 Bluetooth Module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/components_basic/38-component_jdy31.rst:24
msgid "This module **does not support Apple device** connections, so tutorials involving this module require an Android phone or tablet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/components_basic/38-component_jdy31.rst:26
msgid "The JDY-31 Bluetooth module is a pin-compatible replacement for the HC-06 Bluetooth module. It is simpler and easier to use than the HC-06 and is often available at a slightly lower cost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/components_basic/38-component_jdy31.rst:28
msgid "The JDY-31 Bluetooth module is based on Bluetooth 3.0 SPP design and can support Windows, Linux, and Android data transmission. The working frequency of the JDY-31 Bluetooth module is 2.4 GHz with modulation mode GFSK. The maximum transmission power is 8 dB, and the maximum transmission distance is 30 meters. Users can modify the device name through AT command, baud rate, and other instructions."
msgstr ""

